    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> once per turn, you can grant one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> ally within your line of sight a competence bonus on it's next attack roll made before the start of your next turn equal to half your Class Level. Additionally, any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> designated as the target of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Network_Mind\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Network Mind\">Network Mind</a> Class Feature is considered to have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heuristic_Processor\" title=\"Heuristic Processor\">Heuristic Processor</a> whenever it is beneficial, even if it does not actually have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heuristic_Processor\" title=\"Heuristic Processor\">Heuristic Processor</a>.",
